OL,3,ADeath toll from Nepal-Tibet flood jumps
OL,4,Ato at least 469 as fears of second
OL,5,Aflood put rescuers 'on edge'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 469 people have died in Nepal
OL,8,Fand hundreds are missing, more than 48
OL,9,Fhours after flash flooding devastated
OL,10,Fthe Himalayan border region
OL,12,FIn Tibet, three people have died and
OL,13,Fmore than 550 are missing. It is not
OL,14,Fclear if the latest figures overlap
OL,16,FRescuers searching for survivors are
OL,17,F"on edge" over reports that a second
OL,18,Fflood could hit the disaster zone, a
OL,19,FRed Cross official tells the BBC
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
