OL,3,ADeath toll from Nepal-Tibet flood jumps
OL,4,Ato at least 469 as fears of second
OL,5,Aflood put rescuers 'on edge'
OL,6,
OL,7,FTens of thousands of tourists visit the
OL,8,Farea every year - the BBC has been
OL,9,Fspeaking to relatives of the missing.
OL,10,FTwo sisters whose parents are missing
OL,11,Fsay "we just love them a lot and want
OL,12,Fthem to come home"
